<title>NETHERLANDS: GAMMA SELLS HOME TEXTILE RETAIL STORES.</title>
<headline>GAMMA SELLS HOME TEXTILE RETAIL STORES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textiles firm Gamma Holding NV said on Monday it was selling off its 24 household textile retail stores in the Netherlands.    </p>
<p>Gamma said the sale would have a positive effect on its 1997 earnings.</p>
